  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NRC Framework agreement 2013, includ. ACAPS II - NRC Frameworkagreement 2013</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">NRC humram 2013 inklusive st&#xf6;d till ACAPS II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Framework agreement to support refugees and internally displaced      persons in Aghanistan, BurkinaFaso, Colombia, DRC, Ethiopia, Iraq,    Kenya, Mali, Myanmar, the Islamic Republic of Pakistan, occupied      Palestinian territories, Somalia, Southern Sudan,Syria,JordanYemen;   Rapid Response Mechanism, IDMC and program development and support    for ACAPS II.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ramavtal f&#xf6;r flyktingar och internflyktingar i Aghanistan,            BurkinaFaso, Colombia, demokratiska republiken Kongo, Etiopien, Irak, Kenya, Mali, Myanmar, islamiska republiken Pakistan, ockuperade       palestinska omr&#xe5;den, Somalia, Sydsudan, Syrien, Jordanien,Yemen samt  st&#xf6;d Rapid Respons Mechanism, Internal Displacement Monitoring Centre (IDMC), program utveckling och st&#xf6;d till ACAPS II.</narrative>
  </description>
